; M270 — run the X rack oiling cycle now (oil, pause, blow air).
; Remapped in biber3ax.ini: REMAP = M270 modalgroup=10 ngc=m270
; Pulses motion.digital-out-21 (M64/M65 P21) onto the oiler trigger in io.hal;
; the cycle runs on in HAL, the program doesn't wait for it.

o<m270> sub
  M64 P21
  G4 P0.05
  M65 P21
o<m270> endsub
M2
